{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05954","headline":"白鼋涡 · 王维","name":"白鼋涡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山之瀑水兮，激石瀥瀑似雷惊。\n人相对兮，不闻语声。\n翻涡跳沫兮苍苔湿，藓老且厚，春草爲之不生。\n兽不敢惊动，鸟不敢飞鸣。\n白鼋涡涛戏濑兮，委身以纵横。\n王人之仁兮，不网不钓，得遂性以生成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}